  "_palette": "District colors are checked as a ring in this order (health, ai-data, climate, fintech, hardware, commerce), with the first color repeated at the end, by validate_palette.js from the dataviz skill bundled with Claude Code (--mode light, 09-Oct-2026): lightness band, chroma floor, adjacent CVD separation and the normal-vision floor all pass. Two hues sit below 3:1 on the light surface (ai-data #00a3b4 at 2.97:1, commerce #eda100 at 2.11:1), so every district always shows its label and icon beside its color (relief rule). Hardware was #9085e9 until it failed the normal-vision floor against fintech's blue (dE 12.7); #c2185b passes."
